&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:63pt;text-indent:-54pt;"&gt;(注)連結子会社には労働組合は結成されておりません。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:63pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:-54pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:10pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="page-break-before:always; line-height:0.75pt; width:100%; font-size:0.75pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h5 class="smt_head3" style="padding-left:9pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;text-align:justify;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;(4) 管理職に占める女性労働者の割合、男性労働者の育児休業取得率及び労働者の男女の賃金の差異&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:63pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:-54pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;①提出会社の状況&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="tbld" style="margin-left:0pt;margin-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"&gt;
&lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;border:solid 0pt #000000;width:443.3pt;table-layout:fixed;"&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
